rule:
A question gets one of these answers:
- a figure;
- a split ("by …", "per …", "top 5 countries"; "who holds" splits by investor, "where are we most exposed" by country);
- a list of assets ("which assets", "list", or a question starting with assets);
- one asset's card (an asset named alone);
- where to do something in Scope;
- what a term means;
- the data issues;
- the shared folder's latest version.
Two values of one field are compared side by side.
